From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rumisle <why-excuse-quail@duck.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:09:21 +0800
Subject: app/files: download button in the file view

The web app could show a file but not save it. Media, documents and other artifacts get
"Download" in their toolbar; plain text files a download icon in the top corner. It reads the
file again through the API (the loaded copy is decoded text, or empty for large and unknown
binaries), so it works for any server, not only the one serving the app.

Ocelot-Patch: web/file-download

